  "subject": "feat(argocd): sign in with Entra ID",
  "body": "OIDC against the MARTHY.XYZ tenant (app registration argocd-nas, assignment\nrequired). The client secret lives in Vault secret/argocd-entra and reaches\nArgo CD through the ExternalSecret argocd-entra (labelled part-of: argocd so\n$argocd-entra:clientSecret resolves). RBAC: the Entra group argocd-admins maps\nto role:admin; the local admin stays enabled as break-glass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n"
